Description: restore the Hub-kept Orchestrate routing entry and enumeration
Author: Azhou AI Hub
Forwarded: not-needed

Upstream 0.15.43 condensed the poteto-mode routing paragraph and dropped
Orchestrate from it along with the playbook itself. The Hub distribution
still ships hub-skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/orchestrate.md into every
tree, so the retained playbook keeps its normal entry route: standing
project-scale programs route to Orchestrate, figure-it-out keeps the
bespoke-run lane. The condensed playbook list cut Orchestrate's title
too, while the Hub ships twenty-three playbooks, so the patch restores
the title in its base order between Autonomous run and Autopilot-full.
Applies to the pristine poteto-mode SKILL.md before the generator mirrors
it into all five harness trees.

